# Stage 1 held-out (PROPOSAL c69f28e; Advisor go 2026-11-09 for the build, $0): Qwen3-1.7B, GSM8K held-out 250, cut 0.9,
# plain payload, all 10 arms, system settings S1t (PRIMARY: selectivity) then S1 (R1.B1 / R1.B2). One A40, gmail.
# Route: selfdoubt/stage0_full_pod.sh with RUNNER=selfdoubt/stage1_run.py; the held-out step gets --allow-heldout from
# the step's split (s1s2_pod.sh keeps refusing held-out Stage 1). FULL traces: the Stage 0 held-out store, bundled
# byte-identical (FULL_CHECK; all 250 GSM8K FULL present, so no FULL is generated).
# Needs the user's own approval line in the Executor pane.
# Timing (measured on wp1txc49i5wg8r, A40, GSM8K dev, same arms and cut): 2,500 continuations in 1,420.7 s (S1t) and
#   1,472.9 s (S0); held-out continuations at 0.9 are 0.916x dev tokens (Stage 0). Setup ~200 s (create + ssh 37 s,
#   install 66 s, vLLM load ~70 s, copy back ~20 s).
# Central ~2,900 s = 48 min ($0.48); step ceiling 3,900 s, pod ceiling ~4,100 s ($0.68); hard DELETE at 5,100 s =
#   1 h 25 min ($0.84 at $0.59/h; ~$0.85 with disk).
